change_box all triclinic
Changing box ...
  triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (20.706 17.9744 19.970797) with tilt (0 -2.0130661 0)
kspace_style pppm 1.0e-5

# ここから下に MD（fix、compute、run など）を追加します（＋ fix / ＋ compute / ＋ その他）

# ===== soapff：物性の計算（弾性定数 0 K、引張・圧縮、せん断）=====
# (change_box all triclinic is needed for the tilt factors: it is placed before any dump)

# soapff-property: elastic0 strain=0.001 file=elastic0.dat
# 0 K elastic constants (LAMMPS examples/ELASTIC): zero-stress box, then +-strain per direction, atoms relaxed
velocity all set 0.0 0.0 0.0
# zero-stress box: box/relax and fixed-box minimisations alternated 4 times (box/relax alone leaves the
# atoms unrelaxed); the last fixed-box minimisation is the reference, relaxed as the strained states
fix soapff_br all box/relax tri 0.0 vmax 0.001 nreset 20
minimize 0.0 1.0e-8 20000 200000
